        1603,
        1315
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The By-Laws of The Cultural Institutions Retirement System provide in Section 2, Subdivision (1)(b) that with the prior written consent of the Mayor upon written notice to the Committee a Cultural Institution may exclude from Membership in the System any employee who is a member of another retirement system to which the Cultural Institution contributes on such member's behalf.",
